# AiT project rules

Go CLI **toolbox** (**AiT**; tools: **ait**, **aissh**, **ai**, **aiimg**, **ailog**, **aihost**). Module: `github.com/os-artificer/AiT`.

## Commands

- `make build` → `bin/ait`, `bin/aissh`, `bin/ai`, … and `bin/plugins/<tool>/` from `./cmd/<tool>`
- `make test` / `make vet` / `make fmt` — run after Go edits

## Layout

- `cmd/ait`: minimal `main` only (delegates to `ait.Run`)
- `cmd/aissh`: minimal `main` only (delegates to `aissh.Run`)
- `cmd/ai`: minimal `main` only (delegates to `opsai.Run`)
- `internal/ait`: toolbox REPL (Go package `ait`); plugin discovery via `internal/pkg/aitplugin`; interactive Agent Loop via `internal/ait/agent`
- `internal/opsai`: Ops AI Agent CLI (ask/agent one-shot, connect, provider/ollama)
- `internal/ssh`: application entry (Go package `aissh`; **no AI subtree**)
- `pkg/`: only code meant for external import
- Product docs: [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md), [docs/architecture.md](docs/architecture.md), [docs/tools/ait.md](docs/tools/ait.md), [docs/tools/aissh.md](docs/tools/aissh.md), [docs/tools/aissh-internals.md](docs/tools/aissh-internals.md), [docs/tools/ai.md](docs/tools/ai.md), [docs/tools/ai-internals.md](docs/tools/ai-internals.md); archive Cursor plans to `docs/<kebab-case>.md` per [docs-exec-plans.mdc](docs-exec-plans.mdc)

## Scope

- Go code generation/refactoring: follow [go-structure.mdc](go-structure.mdc) and [code-reuse.mdc](code-reuse.mdc) (import order, file layout, constants, exported godoc, line length, nesting, readability, function block spacing, DRY)
- New or changed CLI commands: follow [cli-help.mdc](cli-help.mdc) (`internal/pkg/helpdoc`, per-command `help.go`, `registry` / `subregistry`)
- Merge gate and regression: [change-acceptance.mdc](change-acceptance.mdc) (`make fmt`, `make test`, `make test-cross`; OA*, AG*, R1–R14, …)
- Match existing style (tabs in Go, `.editorconfig`)
- No drive-by refactors; no new markdown unless asked
- Do not commit unless the user requests it
- Do not edit `.git/` or add secrets
- Git commits: no `Co-authored-by: Cursor` / `Made-with: Cursor` ([no-cursor-commit-trailer.mdc](no-cursor-commit-trailer.mdc)); run `make install-git-hooks` once per clone to strip IDE-injected trailers
- **No personal infra in the repo**: do not add real personal hostnames, FQDNs, SSH ports, or IP addresses to code, tests, docs, or project `.cursor/rules`. Use fictional placeholders (`*.example.com`, Host alias `devhost`, port `2222`). Real sandbox/E2E hosts belong in **user-level** Cursor rules (`~/.cursor/rules/`), skills, or local notes — never in the AiT tree.
